{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1140518457178aa02b823a079a03c12767911cedc15171eecdddda3efcb94500", "ja": "（今日は奈緒のPV撮影だった。……が、PV撮影とは\n思えないほど楽しくあっという間に終わってしまった）", "zh": "（今天是奈绪的PV拍摄。……不过，拍摄过程开心得完全不像是在拍PV，一转眼就结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "967451a7715bf7a0a7c2ff7b901d5a0933543c15e020aeb4b8a4089c8e978085", "ja": "撮影、ほんま楽しかったですね～！\nなんや遊園地でジェットコースター乗ってるみたいで！", "zh": "拍摄真的很开心呢～！\n感觉就像在游乐园坐过山车一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "74970455d412a734a628a31fa2dab77d8ea11aa57d1f68336b8d5ad9314262c9", "ja": "こんな撮影やったら、あと5回は……\nいやいや、もう10回は余裕でいけますね！", "zh": "要是这种拍摄，再来5回的话……不不，再来10回也完全没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1820bf15910ed2b48964ec4d5026a8993441fe5b1d0bf4291131c063f1d14eaf", "ja": "じゅっ……！？　さすがにそれは……。\nでも今の奈緒なら、できそうな気がしてしまうな。", "zh": "十……！？　那也太夸张了……\n不过，现在的奈绪，总觉得好像真的能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "30244103b422670e9ebd97a012766d6c7fea4b6fb505bdf25fc19698c0e309cf", "ja": "でしょ？　私としては「まだまだ遊び足りひん！」って\nぐらいですね。", "zh": "对吧？对我来说，差不多就是“还没玩够呢！”这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "4ac8921fe152bd2add45e344b6737e0837b9480e22d9470e6f6472568d5348a2", "ja": "いや、冷静に考えたらお仕事やのに\n「なにが遊びやねん」って感じやと思いますけど……。", "zh": "不过，冷静想想明明是在工作，却说什么“玩乐”啊，应该会有这种感觉吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7649e0e5e12a113f359eff8288e967e0a2632c9c22a151ab9523bc40b111bcea", "ja": "まあ、普通はな。でも、それでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，正常来说是这样。不过，这样不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1c858a07a27b6a0487d03f910b83bbbeba0fa3035c296a9460199eb0caa0597b", "ja": "それだけ奈緒が全力で取り組んでた証拠だと思うし、\n楽しいって気持ちは、何事にも大事な要素だ。", "zh": "我觉得这正是奈绪一直全力以赴的证明，而且“开心”这份心情，无论做什么都是很重要的因素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4222fa43b35e8ac1715925ced2cbeefeb6c1b9f7b5a047783820781f2fbd4a58", "ja": "奈緒は楽しみながら、真剣に仕事をしてたって。\n撮影の様子をみてたからわかるよ。", "zh": "奈绪是在享受其中的同时，也很认真地在工作啊。\n我看着拍摄过程，所以很清楚哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "31a5b8987f45af400ecfaf5d62523b1856ea793b9fceaf8184f482ee934cb6a6", "ja": "そう、ですかね。……え、えへへ。\n確かに、人生楽しんだもん勝ちって言いますし！", "zh": "是、这样吗……欸，嘿嘿。\n确实，人们都说享受人生才是赢家嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "f1eb8ab5c2e5c8dabfe00b0f6a350ea176a6174c812e6d9de20f8316a8398827", "ja": "なんや……思い出しますね。公演で初めてセンターを\nやった時、アレコレ考えすぎてガチガチやったもんな。", "zh": "哎呀……这让我想起来了呢。第一次在公演中担任中心位时，想得太多，整个人都紧绷绷的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "7db46b669104f33408070e20ce855261e98c62fc5b05de5b4025408d8263fe09", "ja": "いつの間にかブレーキかけんと全力で楽しめるまでに\nなったんですね。成長したなぁ、私……。", "zh": "不知不觉间，我已经能够不再压抑自己，\n尽情去享受演出了呢。我也成长了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fe49ccf061629a0753dc7e1623ae825be15459555cfcfe2a5eb136a22c4ebca0", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。奈緒は確実に成長してるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得对。奈绪确实成长了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "aa0b0aef6d9601f3181ed6e2c111d56965924e21464f15917bc7403c9a47dc4e", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます！\n……ってことはですよ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您！\n……也就是说，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "286d94067f0d1ca895dae47232f8cb4c315d8a24121b3824786dbd7cb31175be", "ja": "劇場に足運んでくれるファンのみんなや、PVとか\n見てくれる人も……それにスタッフさんとかも！", "zh": "来到剧场的粉丝们，还有会看PV之类的观众……\n还有工作人员什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "8c1dad4eae4f36c9e259d69dac0a3b7833a21b997a3e6b66b0b99e5ba6ae3aa9", "ja": "私の仕事ぶりみて「あー面白かった！」って、\n笑って、楽しんでもらえてるんですかね～？", "zh": "他们看着我的工作表现，会不会笑着说“啊～真有意思！”然后觉得开心呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_1018", "source_sha256": "d3a3d7ea51e8defcd01039c41897a01c31084c93e4ec638b155f4220a7fe965d", "ja": "大丈夫！", "zh": "没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f004dc06b3bb764be46bfe849572e8c318c5111067d05c0ba60b952c7ae446dd", "ja": "大丈夫って言っても信じられないだろうけど。\nスタッフさんの顔を見てみたらわかるよ。ほら。", "zh": "虽然就算我说没事你可能也不会信。\n不过你看看工作人员的表情就能明白了。瞧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "da5b0af26a8d7a9fce4d2830936f2534cdd912a1e97dcfe259478bb2dd536cbe", "ja": "スタッフさんの……あっ。\nえへへ。アイドル、なってよかった……。", "zh": "工作人员的……啊。\n嘿嘿，能成为偶像真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_2002_037nao", "source_sha256": "4f9faed9433dc391bead81df5493a0bd71ad8365004aa6cebfcd4185052e8a23", "ja": "でも私、もっともーっと頑張ります！\nスーパーセンターアイドルの道は、まだまだですから！", "zh": "不过，我还会更加更加努力的！超级中心偶像之路还长着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_2003_p", "source_sha256": "52674f62796a68f35bcf2484a9c5f65bfbe9ab7eebbc0fd775c92da0f6f9a975", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "啊，是啊。一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "e2b0551a88debce1a430fffa9aa6fdb5a417d116de168915384e6c8cbc9de3ec", "ja": "はい！　一緒に楽しみながら、上を目指すで～！\nこれからもよろしくな、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "好的！一边享受其中，一边向更高处努力吧～！\n今后也请多多关照，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0434_2005_p", "source_sha256": "8cf2bd403107e879e63610d84c05d69c30743021216b0e7a361f5ec9aa825ad1", "ja": "（今後も、奈緒はハイスピードで成長していくだろう。\n振り落とされないように付いていかないとな！）", "zh": "（今后奈绪也会以极快的速度成长吧。\n我得跟上她，不能被甩下！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
